  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.645,
            0.064,
            0.834,
            0.081
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The Other Side of Zero"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.12,
            0.832,
            0.166
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Can there be a number less than 0? Can you think of any ways to have less than 0 of something?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.186,
            0.502,
            0.211
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10.1 Bela’s Building of Fun"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.224,
            0.599,
            0.333
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Children flock to Bela’s ice cream factory to see and taste her tasty ice cream. To make it even more fun for them, Bela purchased a multi-storied building and filled it with attractions. She named it Bela’s Building of Fun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.339,
            0.513,
            0.36
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "But this was no ordinary building!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.608,
            0.25,
            0.858,
            0.366
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.608,
                0.25,
                0.858,
                0.366
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_1_image_5.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.367,
            0.597,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Observe that some of the floors in the"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.389,
            0.833,
            0.432
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "‘Building of Fun’ are below the ground. What are the shops that you find on these floors? What is there on the ground floor?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.438,
            0.832,
            0.482
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A lift is used to go up and down between the floors. It has two buttons: ‘+’ to go up and ‘–’ to go down. Can you spot the lift?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.487,
            0.708,
            0.531
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "To go to the Art Centre from the ‘Welcome Hall’, you must press the ‘+’ button twice."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.537,
            0.569,
            0.558
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We say that the button press is + + or + 2."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.565,
            0.62,
            0.608
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "To go down two floors, you must press the ‘–’ button twice, which we write as – – or –2."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.614,
            0.622,
            0.702
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So if you press + 1 (i.e., if you press the ‘+’ button once), then you will go up one floor and if you press – 1 (i.e., if you press the ‘–’ button once), then you will go down 1 floor."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.714,
            0.481,
            0.781
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Lift button presses and numbers: +++ is written as + 3 – – – – is written as – 4"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.804,
            0.57,
            0.85
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What do you press to go four floors up? What do you press to go three floors down?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
